# Signing material — never commit …
*.keystore
*.jks
*.p12
*.b64
# … except the direct-install distribution key. It is deliberately committed so that every
# release carries the *same* signature and an update installs over the previous version
# ("App not installed" came from a fresh debug key on every CI run). It must never be used
# as a Google Play upload key — configure ANDROID_KEYSTORE_BASE64 for that (docs/SIGNING.md).
!android/mda-distribution.keystore
# Generated store screenshots (built from your own phone captures)
store/screenshots/
